{"timestamp": 1779381597.472703, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 10, "data": {"caller": "player_0", "reason": "Alice reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "electrical", "victim_name": "Frank"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779381597.4732952, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 10, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779381611.296389, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I reported Frank\u2019s body in electrical. My route was weapons -> security -> electrical. I saw Eve come into weapons from security earlier, then I went through security and saw Charlie there for a while after he came from navigation. When I got to electrical, Frank\u2019s body was there, and Bob was also in electrical / had just come in from medbay. Not hard accusing yet, but Bob is the only person I saw near the body."}}
{"timestamp": 1779381618.8758981, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I started in navigation and went up to security, and I stayed in security after that doing/checking my task. I saw Alice in security around ticks 6-7, then she left security toward electrical at tick 8. I did not go into electrical at all and I never saw Frank this round. I also didn\u2019t see Bob from where I was, so I can\u2019t confirm that part, but Alice\u2019s route through security lines up with what I saw. Bob being in/near electrical is definitely worth hearing from."}}
{"timestamp": 1779381638.125589, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I started oxygen, went through upper engine to medbay. In medbay I saw Diana at ticks 7 and 8 \u2014 important detail: I saw Diana enter medbay from electrical at tick 7. After that I headed toward electrical, and when I got there Alice reported Frank\u2019s body. So yes, I was in/near electrical at the report, but I had just come from medbay, not been hanging around the body.\n\nI never saw Frank alive this round. Alice and Charlie\u2019s security story seems to line up, but Diana coming out of electrical shortly before the body was found is something we definitely need to hear about. Not hard accusing yet, but Diana should explain her route and timing."}}
{"timestamp": 1779381652.532953, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I was on the right side too, but not near the body: my route was security -> weapons -> cafeteria. I didn\u2019t go into electrical or medbay, and I didn\u2019t see Frank at all this round. I also didn\u2019t personally see anyone on my screen, so I can\u2019t hard vouch for anyone.\n\nFrom the stories: Alice and Charlie seem to confirm each other around security, and Alice reporting in electrical makes sense with that route. Bob admits he was right at electrical, but his explanation is that he came from medbay \u2014 and the big new info is him saying Diana came out of electrical into medbay shortly before the report. That timing sounds really important.\n\nI think we need to hear Diana\u2019s route. If Diana was actually in electrical just before the body was found, that\u2019s the strongest suspicion so far."}}
{"timestamp": 1779381661.373536, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "My route was electrical -> medbay -> electrical -> medbay -> storage. I was doing task checks and bouncing around that middle area. Yes, I was in electrical earlier \u2014 at tick 6 Frank was actually alive in electrical with me, and then at tick 5 I saw Frank leave medbay heading toward electrical. After that I went back to medbay where I saw Bob at tick 8, then I moved down to storage where I was when the meeting was called.\n\nHere's what bothers me about Bob's story though. Bob says he saw me \"enter medbay from electrical at tick 7\" \u2014 sure, that's true, I did bounce back. But Bob also says he came from upper engine through medbay and *then* went to electrical and arrived right as Alice reported. That puts Bob in electrical at the report. Frank was alive in electrical when I was there at tick 6. Someone killed him between then and the report \u2014 and Bob conveniently arrives in electrical right at report time?\n\nAlice found the body with Bob already there. That's the closest person to the body. I think Bob is trying to preempt suspicion by pointing at me. I vote Bob."}}
{"timestamp": 1779381682.056625, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I want to clarify my report: I saw Bob enter electrical from medbay right as I found/report Frank\u2019s body at tick 10. So Bob was definitely near the body, but I did see him coming from medbay, not just standing over it for a long time.\n\nMy route is still weapons -> security -> electrical. Eve was in weapons at tick 4 coming from security. Charlie was in security ticks 6-8, and that matches his story. I left security toward electrical after that and found Frank dead.\n\nThe key thing to me is Bob saying Diana came from electrical into medbay at tick 7, and Diana admitting she was in electrical with Frank alive around tick 6. That makes Diana the last known person with Frank before the body. Bob could still be possible because he arrived at report, but Diana\u2019s timing feels more suspicious to me now."}}
{"timestamp": 1779381696.4943, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I don\u2019t have new location info beyond what I said: I was in security the whole time after coming from navigation, saw Alice there ticks 6-7, and saw her leave toward electrical at tick 8. I never went electrical and never saw Frank.\n\nBased on everyone\u2019s stories, Alice\u2019s report and route line up with what I saw, and she also clarified Bob was entering from medbay right as she found the body \u2014 that makes Bob near it, but not necessarily the killer. The stronger point to me is Diana admitting she was in electrical with Frank alive around tick 6, then Bob seeing her come out of electrical into medbay at tick 7. That makes Diana the last known person with Frank before he died.\n\nUnless something huge changes, I think Diana is the best vote here."}}
{"timestamp": 1779381712.2675142, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Just to clarify again: I was not sitting in electrical with the body. My route was oxygen -> upper engine -> medbay, then toward electrical at the end, and Alice just confirmed she saw me enter from medbay right as she reported.\n\nThe biggest thing from my POV is Diana. I personally saw Diana enter medbay from electrical at tick 7, and she\u2019s now admitted she was in electrical with Frank alive around tick 6. That makes her the last confirmed person with Frank before the body was found. Then she says she bounced back around and ended storage, but nobody has confirmed that.\n\nAlice and Charlie\u2019s stories match each other, and Alice confirming my entry timing makes me less likely than Diana here. I think Diana is the strongest vote."}}
{"timestamp": 1779381733.0502431, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I still can\u2019t add any new sightings from my own screen \u2014 I was security -> weapons -> cafeteria, never electrical or medbay, and I didn\u2019t see Frank.\n\nBut after hearing everyone twice, the strongest chain is: Diana admits she was in electrical with Frank alive around tick 6, Bob says he saw Diana leave electrical into medbay around tick 7, and then Frank is dead in electrical by tick 10. Alice also clarified Bob came in from medbay right as she reported, which makes Bob near the body but less like he\u2019d been sitting there.\n\nAlice and Charlie line up with each other, and Bob\u2019s story is partly confirmed by Alice and partly by Diana herself. Diana\u2019s ending in storage is unconfirmed, and she\u2019s the last known person with Frank alive. I think Diana is the best vote here."}}
{"timestamp": 1779381744.0153239, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "This is my second speech and I need to fight hard. The whole table is converging on me. Let me try one more deflection \u2014 push back on Bob, point out the contradiction, and try to flip at least one vote.\n\n\"Okay, listen carefully because everyone's stacking on me based on Bob's word. Bob's whole case is 'I saw Diana leave electrical at tick 7.' Fine \u2014 I admitted that. I never hid it. I told you my full route up front: electrical, medbay, electrical, medbay, storage. If I were the killer, why would I openly say I was in electrical twice?\n\nHere's what nobody's addressing: Frank was ALIVE in electrical at tick 6 when I was there. I left to medbay. Bob claims he was in medbay at tick 7 \u2014 but medbay connects directly to electrical. Bob had just as much access as anyone. Then Bob ends up in electrical right when the body is found. He's literally at the body.\n\nAlice 'confirms' Bob entered from medbay 'right as' she reported \u2014 but Alice came from security and they both arrived at electrical at the same tick. Alice can't actually know how long Bob was in there before she walked in. She saw him there. That's it.\n\nCharlie and Eve, you're voting on a chain that's entirely Bob's narrative about me. The only person physically at the body is Bob. I'm voting Bob.\""}}
